{"unit_id":"Ckarefulon__dsh-tailscale-remote#card-zh","repo":"Ckarefulon/dsh-tailscale-remote","commit":"d474e30efe4d89146f9ca0d6e61d8dc337180890","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tailscale-remote（DSH 网页插件）：通过 Tailscale Serve 将本机 DSH Web GUI 提供给 tailnet 设备，并在退出时清理路由。它可连接 Tailscale、提供手机登录链接，并在设置页显示连接状态及更换密钥。远程页面默认加载精简插件集，也能临时切换完整页面；插件还为会话 WebSocket 启用压缩。适合需要从手机或其他 tailnet 设备访问 DSH 的用户，需准备已登录且启用 HTTPS 证书的 Tailscale tailnet 和本机 CLI。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1420-1556","client/client.js:334-414","lite.js:1-30"]}
{"unit_id":"Ckarefulon__dsh-tailscale-remote#card-en","repo":"Ckarefulon/dsh-tailscale-remote","commit":"d474e30efe4d89146f9ca0d6e61d8dc337180890","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-tailscale-remote exposes DSH Web through Tailscale Serve for tailnet devices and removes the route on shutdown. It provides a phone login link, status and key rotation controls, a reduced page mode, and compressed session WebSockets. Requires a signed-in Tailscale tailnet with HTTPS enabled.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1420-1556","client/client.js:334-414","lite.js:1-30"]}
