{"unit_id":"Ckarefulon__dsh-tailscale-remote#feature-1","repo":"Ckarefulon/dsh-tailscale-remote","commit":"d474e30efe4d89146f9ca0d6e61d8dc337180890","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tailscale-remote 的功能「远程连接入口」：插件启动时可建立 Tailscale Serve 路由，并生成一次性登录链接及稳定登录入口；用户从 tailnet 浏览器打开链接即可进入 DSH。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1420-1556"]}
